{"hymn":"S233","parent":"E288","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Qué amigo halle en mi Salvador","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Amados por el Señor","syl":{"n1":["¡Qué‿a","i"],"n2":["mi","m"],"n3":["go‿ha","m"],"n4":["lle‿en","t"],"n5":"mi","n6":["Sal","i"],"n7":["va","m"],"n8":["dor!","t"],"n9":["Me‿a","i"],"n10":["mo","t"],"n11":"a","n12":"mí,‿un","n13":["per","i"],"n14":["di","m"],"n15":["do;","t"],"n16":"Me","n17":["tra","i"],"n18":["jo","t"],"n19":"con","n20":["\"cuer","i"],"n22":["das","t"],"n23":["de‿a","i"],"n24":["mor\",","t"],"n25":["A","i"],"n26":["sí","t"],"n27":["me‿u","i"],"n28":["nió","t"],"n29":["con","i"],"n30":["si","m"],"n31":["go;","t"],"n32":"Me","n33":["ga","i"],"n34":["na‿en","m"],"n35":["te","m"],"n36":["ro‿el","t"],"n37":["co","i"],"n38":["ra","m"],"n39":["zón,","t"],"n40":"De‿Él","n41":["na","i"],"n42":["die","t"],"n43":"me","n44":["se","i"],"n45":["pa","m"],"n46":["ra,","t"],"n47":"Pues","n48":["Su","i"],"n49":["yo","t"],"n50":"soy,‿y‿Él","n51":"es","n53":"mi","n54":["por","i"],"n55":["ción;","t"],"n56":"Él","n57":"es","n58":"mi","n59":["vi","i"],"n60":["da‿e","m"],"n61":["ter","m"],"n62":["na","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Qué amigo‿hallé‿en mi Salvador!","Murió para salvarme;","No sólo el don de vida, mas","Su ser Él quiso darme.","De nada digo, \"es mío\" aquí,","Lo rindo todo‿a Cristo;","Mi corazón, fuerza‿y todo en mí","Por siempre‿a‿Él lo‿entrego."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["¡Qué‿amigo hallé en mi Salvador!","Tan fiel, veraz y tierno;","Potente‿es Él, fuerte defensor","Mi guia‿y consejero;","Del que me ama tanto á mí,","¿Podrá algo apartarme?","¡Ni vida o muerte o‿el Hades vil!","Pues Suyo soy por siempre."]}]}